    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brawl Against Other Online Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena and fight against players from all around the world in this fun and casual online multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/906b36610bd64c6053754fb447ee2966.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Play All  Party Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the different game modes and brawl it out with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/33d53776ba3b729eb16de8d26afd064b.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Tribe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 6 different tribes, each with their own unique special move. Choose wisely to gain an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/1f1744a18ebe597f0be899a65c825fe6.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style and creativity by dressing up your character with cool cosmetic wearable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/21c8ec29622066f8bb5789f4f770ebb0.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brawl Against Other Online Players</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the arena and fight against players from all around the world in this fun and casual online multiplayer game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/906b36610bd64c6053754fb447ee2966.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Play All  Party Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all the different game modes and brawl it out with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/33d53776ba3b729eb16de8d26afd064b.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=456 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Tribe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select from 6 different tribes, each with their own unique special move. Choose wisely to gain an advantage in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/1f1744a18ebe597f0be899a65c825fe6.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Everything</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your style and creativity by dressing up your character with cool cosmetic wearable items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367060/extras/21c8ec29622066f8bb5789f4f770ebb0.avif?t=1738958387\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
